{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cf467613-5c34-58a7-94e9-746b34627d5c", "source_ordinal": 1876, "reading_ordinal": 2180, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "嫁祸", "published_at": "2023-12-23T13:44:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/525430804/answer/3335780313"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "姑娘们，你们要把“嫁”这个概念从自己的字典里直接废除掉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "自己不要说，也不要接纳别人的这种用法。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "有嫁皆祸。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "问“嫁给谁好”，跟问“用什么子弹对脚开枪最好”一样荒唐。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个世界上没有“嫁给谁”这种问题，这种荒唐的事应该灭绝，根本没有资格成为一个需要思考答案的问题。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "只有“与谁结婚”，没有“嫁给谁”。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "现在你把问题换成“谷爱凌会和什么样的人结婚”，有没有感觉到这个问题立刻失去了大部分引人回答的“魅力”？", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你要记住——有些人是要人嫁给他，而不是在找人结婚。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这不是同一回事。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 242}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：谷爱凌会嫁给怎样的人?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“嫁祸”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“姑娘们，你们要把“嫁”这个概念从自己的字典里直接废除掉。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "姑娘们，你们要把“嫁”这个概念从自己的字典里直接废除掉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a58562a4-a778-5540-b0a4-984e884fc586", "source_ordinal": 1875, "reading_ordinal": 2181, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "相亲难", "published_at": "2023-12-23T21:30:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/626477286/answer/3336181114"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "坦率讲，这种带着强烈的明确诉求、有备而来的交往关系，如果在头几次还不能做到无懈可击，暗示着一种很悲观的信号。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这不是“长期相处渐渐不能保持无懈可击”，也不是“无心插柳萍水相逢”，而是在自己选定的时间、选定的地点与自己选定的人选做自己有备而来的交际，这是一个穷尽了一切有利条件的状态。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "对方在这么优厚的条件下如果还让你有不舒服、不淡定的警讯，你最好不要掉以轻心。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为这意味着对方要么对“一个人会在意什么”有某种难以扭转的认知缺陷，要么就意味着对方知道别人要什么但是懒得敷衍。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "无论是哪种可能，都是很严重的问题。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这也是为什么相亲途径其实难度很大的原因，因为相亲就是这样一个条件最理想的战场，客观上抬高了及格线——95分才能算及格。", "char_start": 256, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这也许令人沮丧，但客观上规则就是如此。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 335}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男朋友只对我的身体感兴趣，怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“相亲难”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“坦率讲，这种带着强烈的明确诉求、有备而来的交往关系，如果在头几次还不能做到无懈可击，暗示着一种很悲观的信号。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "坦率讲，这种带着强烈的明确诉求、有备而来的交往关系，如果在头几次还不能做到无懈可击，暗示着一种很悲观的信号。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 54, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "acca4fc3-a939-5aba-a942-33fc168b0d5a", "source_ordinal": 1874, "reading_ordinal": 2182, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "美国议员", "published_at": "2023-12-24T03:45:57+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/635950857/answer/3336395065"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "议员这种事物，普遍都是些职业骗子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为了能毫无障碍的说出雇主要求的鬼话，一般都把大脑和良知切除了。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "坦率的讲，他们一般都不知道自己被授意撕咬的对象到底在哪个大洲，有什么实力。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 87}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一个某国“议员”说了什么话，根本不值得占用公共舆论空间做什么严肃的讨论。这一点美国人——以及各种所谓民主国家的国民们——已经经过几百年的冷眼旁观而形成常识了，人人都知道这些人大嘴巴整天胡扯。", "char_start": 88, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只有大洋彼岸的中国老百姓还比较稚嫩——或曰天真，以为“议员”是一种体面的、有素质的“成功人士”标志，还会在这些认知操纵工具身上投入注意力。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "慢慢会学会的，莫急。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 264}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：美议员称若大陆「入侵」台湾，将推动美方制裁中国，外交部回应，哪些信息值得关注？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“美国议员”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“议员这种事物，普遍都是些职业骗子。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "议员这种事物，普遍都是些职业骗子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a623fb54-aaca-5b8b-9728-92023fa470d7", "source_ordinal": 1873, "reading_ordinal": 2183, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "吃瓜", "published_at": "2023-12-24T12:35:57+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/505679875/answer/3336675525"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人其实问错了问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "真正的问题是——日本西瓜卖得这么贵，而日本人又不是不爱吃，为什么这么多年没有增产？", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "它为什么一直很贵？", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "要知道，一旦一个东西出了名的被嫌贵，前提一定是有很多人想买。没人想买的东西，你定价再高，别人只会觉得你好笑，没有人会来嫌你贵。普遍嫌贵，就是普遍有需求。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "为什么它没有人增产？把价格打下来？这都说多少年了，怎么还在喊贵？", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你们没有发现吗？在中国这个问题几乎不存在，这么多年，一旦有一个什么易耗品普遍有人嫌贵，它很难把这个贵的美名坚持十年。虽然有的“降价”是通过自身价格不变但人均收入飞涨的方式实现的，但绝不乏产品自身就价格大跌的“惨剧”。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个现象为什么没有发生在日本的西瓜身上？其实何止西瓜，日本还有很多方面远远的落后时代，仿佛冻结在了时光隧道中。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "要知道，类似的效应可以在奢侈品上有效，而奢侈品——例如钻石、香水这些——是因为有人在刻意控制造成的。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "众所周知，德比尔斯实际上是根据市场需求，有比例的控制着自己的产量来维持钻石的市价的。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 432}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而另一类例子是石油。产油国也在有意的控制产量来保证自己的利益。因为石油是大宗消耗的战略物资，存在大量的刚需，这给了产油国操作的基础。", "char_start": 433, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但在西瓜这样既非战略物资、也谈不上奢侈品的品类上，日本的市场为何仍然失灵？在这里我们不想去谈论日本农协的强大、日本的政局的种种土八卦。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为无论你如何将这描述得似乎是一种风俗、一种民族风情、异国情调，都改变不了这样一个客观现实——日本几乎失去了解决自身问题的能力。", "char_start": 568, "char_end": 632}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "西瓜只是诸多症状之中比较典型的表现罢了。", "char_start": 633, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "日本普通人的生活真正不如中国年轻人的地方在于——ta们的国家已经失去了两种能力：", "char_start": 655, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "1）失去了制止形形色色的“产油国”在各种民生物资、日常服务方面搞“主动减产”策略的能力，即对内博弈能力。", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "2）失去了通过对外发展让民众的收入和前途持续增长的能力，即对外博弈能力。", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 785}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "日本普通人和中国普通人的生活水平真正的差异在于，日本人缺少国家和民族的希望。注意，不是“规划”“战略”——这种东西ta们多的很——而是真正的希望。", "char_start": 786, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在国内看到的是一片板结的格局——财阀世家已经实现了内循环，类似西瓜贵了几十年没人敢冒险增产“扰乱市场”的行为已经遍地都是。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 921}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "在国外看到的是欲振乏力——日本已经多年在海外、国际没有开拓出什么新的战略空间。美国留下的施展空间本就有限，而中国还在将日本全面挤出。", "char_start": 922, "char_end": 988}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因此日本人呈现出了普遍的自暴自弃的败犬状态。", "char_start": 989, "char_end": 1011}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "类似神待少女问题、妇女贫困问题、御宅族问题、孤独死问题……现在看日本的动漫，几乎完全失去了九十年代以前那些经典作品的乐观、朝气。", "char_start": 1012, "char_end": 1076}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那都不是一个开玩笑的“躺平”的心态，而是一种陶醉于自我戕害，以玩弄“病娇”“腹黑”之类的病态为乐的状态。在活里找不到希望，于是在死里寻找刺激的状态。", "char_start": 1077, "char_end": 1151}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这跟打一小时工能买几斤西瓜几乎没有关系。", "char_start": 1152, "char_end": 1172}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "日本人没有奋力挣扎吗？也并非完全没有。", "char_start": 1173, "char_end": 1192}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这就要谈到日本现在的紧迫危机。", "char_start": 1193, "char_end": 1208}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "美国应该已经意识到了这样一个注定的结局——台湾保不住，台湾倒下之后，日本和韩国也会连环丧失。", "char_start": 1209, "char_end": 1255}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "因此美国正在“下决心保住”和“坚壁清野”之间犹豫。", "char_start": 1256, "char_end": 1281}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "其实这才是日本和韩国激进“抗中”的真相——ta们害怕美国失去信心后走向“如果我保不住，那么这些被放弃的地盘上一粒米也不要留给中国”的方向。", "char_start": 1282, "char_end": 1351}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "最近发生了一件小事，看似不起眼，实际上却是重大事件——安倍派和二阶堂派被东京地检特搜部清算，意味着这种“靠证明自己的战略价值换取不被毁灭性收割”的策略已经趋向失败了。", "char_start": 1352, "char_end": 1435}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "美国已经失去了信心和建立在这信心上的耐心，可能已经转向了“趁着台湾还没有倒下，先没收日韩可能带给中国的嫁妆”这样的方向。", "char_start": 1436, "char_end": 1496}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "日本和韩国接下来的这几年，非常的不乐观。", "char_start": 1497, "char_end": 1517}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "西瓜恐怕会更吃不起。", "char_start": 1518, "char_end": 1528}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 33}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：从日本人吃不起西瓜来看，日本普通人生活是否还不如国内年轻人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032"], "summary": "围绕“吃瓜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人其实问错了问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人其实问错了问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9394d674-befb-5836-b4ba-021602c01480", "source_ordinal": 1872, "reading_ordinal": 2184, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "扛不住军训的人", "published_at": "2023-12-24T17:43:37+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/421911108/answer/3336930645"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说实在点，对大学生军训这种强度的纪律要求都“痛恨”的人，不要埋怨别人看不起你。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这种娇生惯养、唯我独尊的状态，没有人敢或者有兴趣对你做任何指望。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如此无能且懦弱的人，已经提前就注定了不可能有什么产出、不可能分担任何压力和风险，却明确可知有任何压力就一定会掉链子。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 131}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "等于提前就知道肯定有百害而无一益，谁这么想不开给自己的人生增加困难？", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "别说车轮子、大灯，你会在自己车上装哪怕一个一震动就会掉的螺丝吗？", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你要抱怨困难，最好心里有点谱——你绝不能抱怨这种大多数人听了会把你拉进“不能寄予任何期待”的名单的东西。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "就算要抱怨，也只能抱怨点绝大多数人都被证明承受不了的困难，那好歹不至于一次性把自己社会性流放。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "当众说这种话，简直比对着自己的脚开一枪还严重。脚打个洞还可以养好，这种轻蔑一旦形成，你在对方眼里直接变植物人了——要不要跟你打交道要先等你出院再说，而且近几年都不会有人一轮轮去医院看你醒过来没有。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "读到大学竟然还意识不到这种近乎当众自裁的行为的危险性，父母教育严重失职。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你们自己有小孩的，请确保ta读大学之前就对这种愚行有基本的敏感性。", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 470}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：作为大学生，在接受军训时愈发痛恨普鲁士式军事训练，我该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“扛不住军训的人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说实在点，对大学生军训这种强度的纪律要求都“痛恨”的人，不要埋怨别人看不起你。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说实在点，对大学生军训这种强度的纪律要求都“痛恨”的人，不要埋怨别人看不起你。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "295b75f7-e606-56df-897e-76ab80f60f8e", "source_ordinal": 1871, "reading_ordinal": 2185, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "严肃活泼", "published_at": "2023-12-24T22:39:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/22562949/answer/3337180656"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "严肃的意思是“以上内容均为真实陈述，本人对此陈述承担相应责任”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "活泼的意思是“以上陈述我将尽量保证趣味性，如果你能从中得到快乐，我将感到欣慰”。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "说能验证、能兑现的负责任的、不浪费别人时间和感情的话，但幽默的说、松快的说，令人身心愉悦的说。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这是一种非常高超的处事风格，天然的魅力四射，既胜过一切不当真的所谓“纯娱乐”，又超越一切令人抑郁、绝望的通牒和恐吓。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你要是能做到，就会有人愿意陪你钻山洞、喝南瓜汤、拎着两把菜刀把脑袋别在裤腰带里追随你赴汤蹈火，面对断头台，也能笑谈“泉台招旧部，旌旗斩阎罗”，把抛头颅洒热血的庸夫畏途变成充满乐观主义的浪漫旅途。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "事实上，可以这么说——活泼是你对愿意与你同行严肃道路的同伴的一种应尽礼仪，起码的关怀。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "真正的敢死队员，总有一切的理由创造快乐。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 343}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "那些不能感应这种浪漫境界的人，何其不幸——其实，不严肃的人也没有机会真正的活泼。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 385}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「严肃活泼」是什么意思？怎样才能称为严肃活泼？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008"], "summary": "围绕“严肃活泼”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“严肃的意思是“以上内容均为真实陈述，本人对此陈述承担相应责任”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "严肃的意思是“以上内容均为真实陈述，本人对此陈述承担相应责任”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ff04684f-2a31-597c-9569-196876a63c80", "source_ordinal": 1870, "reading_ordinal": 2186, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无敌铁公鸡", "published_at": "2023-12-25T22:01:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/635343276/answer/3338337577"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有几条商业道德是这样的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）虽然有破产保护可以利用，但是有德行的人不会故意利用这个规则去过分透支别人的信任。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）对欠薪、欠债未还的人，“豪爽大气”、“不铁公鸡”是一种道德缺陷——有钱大方，却没钱还债。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "简单来说，“铁公鸡”是做人的风格差异，在不涉及背弃信用、撕毁合约、赖账逃债的前提下，没有任何可指责之处。不但无可指责，在上述前提下却要去指责、攻击别人“铁公鸡”，属于一种贪得无厌的精神外露，实际上是一种因为别人不满足ta自己的贪欲而行的报复。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "别人跟你签的合同是怎样就是怎样，除此之外认定别人还有额外的支付义务，不给就要骂人铁公鸡，这种行为说白了就是既贪且恶。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "此外，一个欠债、赖账的人推崇、鼓吹豪爽，这其实是一种难言的卑鄙。你们不是ta的受害人，所以只会拿来当“勇者斗恶龙”的戏码来欣赏。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你想想看，看到一个坑你投资、赖你货款的人大讲这些豪言壮语，指责一个不欠薪、不赖债的企业家“铁公鸡”，你心里是什么看法？", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "分不清这点是非，本身是一种道德伦理混乱的表现，对你的职业生涯可以说没有任何好处。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "锤子科技拖欠员工11月工资，罗永浩这次没有回应 - 21财经", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "“不要把善良当软柿子捏”，知名投资人向罗永浩追讨1500万元！", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 512}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老罗说俞敏洪是铁公鸡，老罗作为老板人怎样？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“无敌铁公鸡”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有几条商业道德是这样的：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有几条商业道德是这样的：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "26c8e725-ccda-5e4f-bced-fce907307ff9", "source_ordinal": 1869, "reading_ordinal": 2187, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "X战警", "published_at": "2023-12-26T13:25:32+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/635495212/answer/3338998409"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然打得过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "问题是已经跟俄罗斯在打了，所以对美国而言，不存在这个“单独跟胡塞武装对决”的场景。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "游戏规则是在 US vs RUS的现状下，美国要不要选择改赛 US vs RUS + X + IRN + CHN + PRK的比赛。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "现在任何一个小弟（X）跳起来挑衅美国，都不是要参加US vs X的比赛，都是在笃定美国不愿意参加 US vs RUS + X + IRN + CHN + PRK的比赛。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "X能不能赢，不影响X对美国不敢动手的判断。", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 222}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "是上一个X赌了而且赌赢了，导致下一个X更确定美国不敢打 US vs RUS + X + X + IRN + CHN + PRK。", "char_start": 223, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "上上个X又赌赢了，导致下下个更确定美国不敢打 US vs RUS + X + X + X + IRN + CHN + PRK。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，做人一定要吸取这种教训——你必须尊重实力相近的对手。因为一旦你迈过某条自然法确定的权利界限，导致对方对你的敌意得到了所有其他人的确认和期待，自然法就会发动起无数的X——而不是这位对手本身——来无穷尽的惩罚你。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你一定要走霸道的路线，那么你就要选择一些亲密朋友，保证你们之和绝对大于你的敌人和任何一个X之和。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "否则X战警们必定会前仆后继，如潮水般涌来，直到你跪地投降或者自取灭亡。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "说白了，老天爷不喜欢人选择霸权道路，从铜锣湾到全地球，都一样。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 578}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0324"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：现在的美国能打赢胡塞武装吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“X战警”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然打得过。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然打得过。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
